The ICC permits copying, distribution, embedding, manufacture, use and sale
without restriction. Modified profiles must remove original identification and
copyright information and must not be represented as the original profile.
This is a summary; the linked ICC licensing terms govern this profile.

The binary fixture and embedded Swift byte array are unchanged original bytes,
including the profile copyright tag. The profile is not relicensed under the
repository's Apache-2.0 licence. It labels decoded sRGB values after the explicit
XYB inverse; it is not a general-purpose colour conversion implementation.
